-- REAL-TIME vs PRE-COMPUTED:
-- ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

-- Use PRE-COMPUTED for:
-- - Dashboard widgets
-- - Historical charts
-- - Period comparisons
-- - Export reports

-- Use REAL-TIME queries for:
-- - Today's live numbers (query shipment_financials directly)
-- - Drill-down details
-- - Specific transaction lookup


-- DATA FLOW:
-- ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

-- Raw Tables (Real-time)          Pre-computed (Fast reads)
-- ─────────────────────           ─────────────────────────
-- shipment_financials    ───┐
-- wallet_transactions    ───┼───► Go Worker ───► financial_reports
-- commission_transactions───┤     (cron)         financial_reports_by_org
-- invoice_payments       ───┘                    financial_reports_by_carrier
-- */